content:
The ordering table defines two SKUs (commercial vs industrial). Wavelength and protocol values share one technical row; assign the transmit band (1540–1560 nm, center 1550) per the transmitter row. `SO-CSFP-1000BASE-BX10D-53-O2` is not a separate orderable line—only the two `Base` / `-I` codes are used.

```json
{
  "modes": [
    {
      "label": "CSFP BiDi 10km TX1550/RX1310 Commercial",
      "model": "SO-CSFP-1000Base-BX10D-53-O2",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1540.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1560.0,
      "wavelength_center_nm": 1550.0,
      "standards_code": "1000BASE-BX10D"
    },
    {
      "label": "CSFP BiDi 10km TX1550/RX1310 Industrial (-I)",
      "model": "SO-CSFP-1000Base-BX10D-53-O2-I",
      "wavelength_min_nm": 1540.0,
      "wavelength_max_nm": 1560.0,
      "wavelength_center_nm": 1550.0,
      "standards_code": "1000BASE-BX10D"
    }
  ]
}
```
